    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not temporary though. it's just how things are here. if i try to be myself, everything falls apart. the people around me, my family... they dont want \"me\", they want the version of me that makes them look good. i feel like i'm just performing a role every single day. i'm so tired of pretending. i just want to be free of it all. i just want the noise to stop. maybe there is no version of me that actually gets to exist in this world without",
