      "content": "but you don't get it. the world isn't \"vast\" for someone like me. the walls are too high. every time i try to find a way to be \"authentic,\" it's like I'm just suffocating more. i feel like i'm already dead, honestly. like i'm just waiting for my body to catch up to the person who already stopped existing months ago. i just want to find a way to finally have some control... to actually have an exit from this performance. isn't there ever just a way to finally be at peace and just stop?\n-turn-end ury. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
